      "en": "The woman conceived and bore a son. When she saw that he was a fine child, she hid him three months.",
      "ko": "그 여자가 잉태하여 아들을 낳아 그 준수함을 보고 그를 석달을 숨겼더니",
      "source_text_hash": "5f5244f402fb621fcfb915a18993cbdf90ea4ea1f73c6a05893309f70cbedc73",
      "translation_text_hash": "5bb98dce683245179ae63b20e37356cd2db449efdccf4d07e58e2159265b271e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 여자가 잉태하여 아들을 낳아 그 준수함을 보고 그를 석달을 숨겼더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5bb98dce683245179ae63b20e37356cd2db449efdccf4d07e58e2159265b271e"
      ]
