      "en": "His sister stood far off, to see what would be done to him.",
      "ko": "그 누이가 어떻게 되는 것을 알려고 멀리 섰더니",
      "source_text_hash": "326ee778d977f81da00558894341d15163fff1ac9dca7daced22edad62712365",
