      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "He looked this way and that way, and when he saw that there was no one, he killed the Egyptian, and hid him in the sand.",
      "ko": "좌우로 살펴 사람이 없음을 보고 그 애굽 사람을 쳐죽여 모래에 감추니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e1a283c4fb0bc712f871fba120e728ec9a55c2058bc50e2fbfbc545f52fbc222",
      "translation_text_hash": "08a531b3e8cee0da547ff0787ab8c77bc7d3c946e5e72f7c071e4bfd3d32cb1c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "좌우로 살펴 사람이 없음을 보고 그 애굽 사람을 쳐죽여 모래에 감추니라"
      ],
