      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "He said, “Who made you a prince and a judge over us? Do you plan to kill me, as you killed the Egyptian?” Moses was afraid, and said, “Surely this thing is known.”",
      "ko": "그가 가로되 누가 너로 우리의 주재와 법관을 삼았느냐 네가 애굽 사람을 죽임 같이 나도 죽이려느냐 모세가 두려워하여 가로되 일이 탄로되었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "4cf7769f4fd84d2f5ca1f1e0028d305c59e50e1903c20d0d4dee33a31a41b30d",
