      "en": "The shepherds came and drove them away; but Moses stood up and helped them, and watered their flock.",
      "ko": "목자들이 와서 그들을 쫓는지라 모세가 일어나 그들을 도와 그 양무리에게 먹이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f9e99ddde270d721f2fad74220c31c76faaae2fc5eb49abfe509c6a4b59e8f28",
