      "en": "She bore a son, and he named him Gershom, for he said, “I have lived as a foreigner in a foreign land.”",
      "ko": "그가 아들을 낳으매 모세가 그 이름을 게르솜이라 하여 가로되 내가 타국에서 객이 되었음이라 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "0d8ed922f77f7ee9ad2ab3b76009f7f1963441cf28fbeaa34561e0d8d9f6f754",
      "translation_text_hash": "d5df0bb34f2c183269a6c8bef902149e7eaaa92edbfd7d749aa6f481f0be3bb5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
