      "en": "God heard their groaning, and God remembered his covenant with Abraham, with Isaac, and with Jacob.",
      "ko": "하나님이 그 고통 소리를 들으시고 아브라함과 이삭과 야곱에게 세운 그 언약을 기억하사",
      "source_text_hash": "839ac1f629de4bbb8b52ac8cc25c6bde12dacf3c250aa5e7b71b92d31ca462d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "d6ab6c8bd4dcd36eeef2cfe48bebd43b8dc9259e7a1aa932eb1541da6a620ace",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
